# apps/backend/text/.gitignore
# C-392: the text dev engine no longer writes model weights into this tree.
# Model weights live in the shared aikami-models store, fetched via the
# C-390 manifest-driven fetcher:
#   cd apps/backend/local-stack && bun run fetch-models
# The legacy Ollama tree (src/cache/ollama) was retired. The opt-in
# text-ollama service keeps its store in the aikami-ollama-models named
# volume, so legacy blobs are NOT auto-reused — copy them into that volume
# manually if you want them back. Nothing in this project is expected to be
# ignored anymore.
